graph\">Surgical treatment of conditions affecting the liver, bile ducts, pancreas and spleen.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hernia surgery</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Repair of abdominal wall and groin hernias, using laparoscopic techniques where suitable.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Morbid obesity surgery</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Surgical treatment options for severe obesity.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Breast surgery</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Surgical treatment of breast diseases.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Endocrine surgery</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Operations on the thyroid and adrenal glands.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Soft tissue tumours</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Surgical removal of tumours in the soft tissues.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Vascular access for dialysis</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Creation of an arteriovenous (A-V) fistula or shunt for patients who need haemodialysis.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-cons